# DeckardSystem answers links, numbers, places, settings pages, pickers and
# the camera for Android apps by handing them to Marathon (docs/slim.md).
# While the stock browser is still in the image, links need it to be the
# default browser, or Android asks which one to use.
on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    exec_background - root root -- /system/bin/cmd role add-role-holder android.app.role.BROWSER org.marathonos.deckard.system
